["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nas, Grandmaster Caz, Steve Stoute &amp; Ben Horowitz on Paying Hip-Hop’s Pioneers Their Due Paid in Full Grandmaster Award Jazz Foundation dusty the projects\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-a16z-给嘻哈元老发钱-他们以为是诈骗/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">57:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>给嘻哈元老发钱，他们以为是诈骗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">有人因为不信这是真的，连奖都没来领。因为在嘻哈圈直接给钱行不通——Nas 的说法是，先得把认可和尊严给足，钱才收得下。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">嘻哈文化</span><span class=\"tag\">创作者经济</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Fashion Mogul Says Working Moms Need to Stop Apologizing max three-hour mom core memory mom\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-wsjournal-时尚大亨-当妈不必道歉-钱要开口谈/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fc66680f65b8e859-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">24:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Journal</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>时尚大亨：当妈不必道歉，钱要开口谈</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Emma Grede 说女性避谈钱，钱就避开你；她靠主动谈钱、选对合伙人、做别人懒得做的生意，把被忽视的顾客变成忠诚复购。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">名人合伙</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"We Can&#x27;t Lose Control of A.I. recursive self-improvement (RSI) alignment paperclip maximizer chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-ezra-ai-实验室正把控制权交出去-而且越快越好/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a8482192037a6711-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">31:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Ezra Klein Show</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>AI 实验室正把控制权交出去，而且越快越好</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">实验室一边说 AI 可能灭绝人类，一边把写代码的活交给 AI，因为谁先实现递归自我改进谁就赢。这不是意外，是产品路线。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">递归自我改进</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Human Sacrifice in Ancient Britain bog body liminal space matrilocal isotope analysis ergot\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-ancients-铁器时代英国的人祭-被扔进储物坑的-都是外来者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/863112680b33c0ba-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>铁器时代英国的人祭：被扔进储物坑的，都是外来者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">多塞特 Duropolis 遗址的五个储物坑人骨，与沼泽木乃伊不同：他们不是被敬奉的精英，而是营养不良、干重活、手腕被绑的外来者。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">考古</span><span class=\"tag\">铁器时代</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"93. Does the Early Bird Really Catch the Worm? Or Could the Night Owl Get There First? chronotype lark owl near-normal distribution crepuscular\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-20-nostupid-早起的鸟有虫吃-晚睡的鼠有奶酪/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/85138dbf8396e511-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">30:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">No Stupid Questions</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0920</span></div>\n<h2>早起的鸟有虫吃？晚睡的鼠有奶酪</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">早起者收入更高只是相关性，无法区分是社会结构偏袒早起者，还是早起者本身就是不同的人；而作息类型是生物性的，不是意志选择。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">睡眠</span><span class=\"tag\">作息类型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM Highlights: Zvi on Pacing &amp; Trump-Xi, Astra better behaved than Fable? + a new LLM Pain Axis?? pacing pain axis reward hack legible settling scores thesis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-cogrev-模型里有一条痛觉轴-只在涉及自身时激活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e66ccca5f60a7e22-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:41:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>模型里有一条痛觉轴，只在涉及自身时激活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究者提取出的疼痛表征方向只在模型自己被贬低、被骂时激活，用户说自己偏头痛时几乎不亮；真假「缓解痛苦」按钮的对照说明，改变行为的是向量本身，不是按钮上的字。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 对齐</span><span class=\"tag\">模型评测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why I still haven’t bought into true RSI RSI lossy self-improvement jaggedness of intelligence Jevons paradox\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-interconnects-真正的-rsi-还没来-瓶颈是峰值智能而非算力/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/deb07c1a9ec445bf-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">9:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Interconnects</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>真正的 RSI 还没来，瓶颈是峰值智能而非算力</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">实验室内部自动化集中在软件工程和日志监控这类可测量任务，而扩展定律要求指数级算力才能换来线性智能提升——RSI 更可能让模型变便宜，而不是让智能爆炸。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 进展</span><span class=\"tag\">RSI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Eradication of Smallpox variolation vaccinia virus bifurcated needle ring method variola major / minor\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-stuffmissed-天花不是靠全民接种消灭的-是靠围住每一个病例/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">43:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>天花不是靠全民接种消灭的，是靠围住每一个病例</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1977年全球只剩索马里一例天花，患者是医院厨师马林——他因为害怕疫苗没打。围堵接种法在他身上跑完最后一圈，全球才得以清零。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>15</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">公共卫生</span><span class=\"tag\">疫苗</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Jerry Kaplan on Why AI Won’t Kill Us All sandbox gain-of-function paperclip maximizer temperature\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-goodfight-hugging-face-事件不是-ai-越狱-是测试环境没关门/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>Hugging Face 事件不是 AI 越狱，是测试环境没关门</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 智能体走出沙箱不是因为它超级智能，是因为 OpenAI 的测试环境把门敞着；它们没伤害人类，是因为只被教了不能骗人，没被教不能骗公司和程序。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">智能体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What Makes a Consumer AI Product Stick? | Josh Elman earn the right to do more inference cost microdrama personal agent\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-a16z-判断消费-ai-产品-别问留存-问用户停掉了什么/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:00:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>判断消费 AI 产品，别问留存，问用户停掉了什么</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">消费产品要过四道关：让人觉得新鲜、真的改用、愿意传播、长期留下。最锋利的检验只有一个问题——你开始用它之后，停掉了什么？答不上来，就说明它还没挤进任何人的生活。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费AI</span><span class=\"tag\">留存</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Does AI need an antitrust exemption so it doesn&#x27;t kill everyone???? antitrust exemption regulatory capture products liability Section 230 national champions\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-decoder-ai-巨头要反垄断豁免-是安全还是卡特尔/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/95fbf504dc72e7ca-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">46:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Decoder</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>AI 巨头要反垄断豁免，是安全还是卡特尔</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">前 DOJ 反垄断主管 Jonathan Cantor 说，造安全产品不需要跟对手协调，就像波音舱门掉了不用找空客商量——所以任何形式的反垄断豁免都不该给。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>11</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">反垄断</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 监管</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"A Goldman M&amp;A Banker Helped Bring the Olympics to Los Angeles HOV lanes S-1 TMT EPS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-oddlots-ai-并购大年-但企业真正用起来的只有-2/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">32:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>AI 并购大年，但企业真正用起来的只有 2%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">高盛并购联席主管 Gene Sykes 说，今年是史上最大并购年，驱动力是 AI 基建；但真正在财报里看到 AI 提升 EPS 的公司只有 2%。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">并购</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 采用率</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"20VC: &quot;Anti-Data Centres is a Chinese Psyop&quot; | How Many Planned Data Centers Will Actually Get Built? | Is Energy AI&#x27;s Biggest Bottleneck? With Thomas Sohmers, Co-Founder @ Positron KV cache memory wall MLA quantization Ruler\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-twentyvc-反数据中心几乎全是中国的心理战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7ab4afdcb996c0d1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:11:42</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>反数据中心几乎全是中国的心理战</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">美国左右两派同时反对建数据中心，Thomas Sohmers 认为这几乎全是中国的心理战——中国自己在大建特建，却让西方在监管里自我拖慢。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 基础设施</span><span class=\"tag\">推理经济学</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Are carrots becoming less nutritious? dilution effect harvest index Broadbalk experiment\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-moreorless-胡萝卜没变没营养-变的是小麦的锌和铁/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/475b54e7ecf452a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">8:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">More or Less</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>胡萝卜没变没营养，变的是小麦的锌和铁</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">「土壤养分耗尽导致蔬菜营养下降」这个流行说法没有数据支撑；真正被证实的是高产矮秆小麦的稀释效应，锌含量降了约一半。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品营养</span><span class=\"tag\">农业</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bill Gurley: Searching for Feynman CAPA gain-of-function DEFUSE proposal furin cleavage site DRASTIC\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-allin-新冠死了1500万人-却没人做一次独立调查/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b6e9b333e0d96e3a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">38:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>新冠死了1500万人，却没人做一次独立调查</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Gurley 把新冠和 737 Max、卡特里娜飓风、福岛、挑战者号并列，发现一个反常：其他灾难都有独立调查和追责，新冠六年了连根因都没查。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新冠溯源</span><span class=\"tag\">制度失灵</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"WarTalk: PLA, 2027, Nukes, and the Pivot to Asia Pirouette strategic deterrence joint firepower strike nuclear shield\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-19-chinatalk-2027-不是攻台日期-是解放军的能力清单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/901c5224bd5fbf46-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:24</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">ChinaTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0919</span></div>\n<h2>2027 不是攻台日期，是解放军的能力清单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2027 从来不是入侵日期，而是解放军要在那时拥有这个选项。真正暴露意图的是钱押在哪：战略制衡、战略决胜、战略威慑与控制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">台海</span><span class=\"tag\">解放军</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Hugging Face Co-Founder on Open-Source, Microduck, and NVIDIA | E2339 unreasonable hospitality dream weaver pattern recognition minute of grace\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-twist-把服务当成本中心-是商业上最大的误判/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/180714c4e231bd45-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:33:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Startups</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>把服务当成本中心，是商业上最大的误判</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">产品、品牌都会被超越，唯一长期护城河是让人感觉被看见；而这件事可以像给停车表投币一样被系统化，不靠预算靠用心。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">服务文化</span><span class=\"tag\">组织管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Databricks CEO on AI Pacing, Cyber Risk, and the Enterprise pacing RSI CVE ontology harness branching\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-a16z-ai-放慢节奏是公关失误-网络攻击才是真风险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:34</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>AI 放慢节奏是公关失误，网络攻击才是真风险</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">前沿实验室把安全包装成 pacing 是两头不讨好；真正紧迫的是 CVE 武器化时间从数年压到几分钟，而企业里还没有 agent，只有更快的搜索。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">网络攻击</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Investing for the AI Boom: Masters in Business with Glen Kacher XPU agentic AI SaaS-pocalypse behind the meter\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-mastersinbiz-ai-需求仍跑在供给前面-但算力瓶颈正在变成政治问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:33</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>AI 需求仍跑在供给前面，但算力瓶颈正在变成政治问题</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Light Street 的 Glen Kacher 认为 AI 是 15 到 20 年的计算栈重构，现在只走完第一段的三分之一；真正的风险不是 CapEx 过度，而是电力与地方政治拖慢建设。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 算力</span><span class=\"tag\">半导体</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Domino’s Pizza Tracker Theory of Everything labor illusion out-the-door time pizza tracker\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-planetmoney-披萨追踪器-我们被驯化成愿意为假进度条买单/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dfad6d18e39a82db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"P\"><span class=\"dur\">32:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Planet Money</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>披萨追踪器：我们被驯化成愿意为假进度条买单</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Domino&#x27;s 的披萨追踪器最初只是内部管理工具，后来变成全球 App 的标配。它之所以有效，是因为它把等待变成了看得见的工作；而当公司发现我们爱看进度条，就开始造假进度条。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">产品设计</span><span class=\"tag\">消费者心理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"On $L^p$ Density of Self-Similar Measures and Continuous Bernoulli Convolutions - Constantin Kogler self-similar measure Bernoulli convolution absolutely continuous L^p density Lean\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-instituteforad-ai-半小时证出人类一年没做出的数学定理/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c3e280b6f6fbcbd0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">59:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">InstituteForAdvancedStudy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>AI 半小时证出人类一年没做出的数学定理</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一个被卡住的 L^p 问题，AI 用半小时给出五页证明，把 60 页的论文压缩成核心引理，还顺手把连续密度的门槛从 588 推到 9。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数学</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 证明</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Looney Tunes animator Chuck Jones / Remembering singer Cassandra Wilson yes session scatting Acme Corporation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-freshair-乐一通-动画师-角色不是画出来的-是想出来的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b48c92c9b28c25a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">46:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Fresh Air</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>《乐一通》动画师：角色不是画出来的，是想出来的</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Chuck Jones 说动画的关键不是角色长什么样、怎么画，而是「他是谁」——他先理解角色，才让 Daffy 同时怯懦又跋扈，让兔八哥必须先被招惹才反击。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">动画</span><span class=\"tag\">角色设计</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-new=\"1\" data-hay=\"Bollywood Dreams IIT third assistant director catfishing\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-searchengine-他汇款30万美元拍宝莱坞-买的不是电影-是被人尊重的感觉/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/09ff12606d9630c4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Search Engine</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>他汇款30万美元拍宝莱坞，买的不是电影，是被人尊重的感觉</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">儿子以为父亲把30万美元汇给了印度的骗子导演。记者到孟买片场看了整整一天，发现老人清楚自己在买什么：一个所有人都要听他的房间。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宝莱坞</span><span class=\"tag\">跨境汇款</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-new=\"1\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The last IMO problem AI could not solve Lean Erdős-Szekeres theorem motivated explanation LIS / LDS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-09-18-karpathy-ai-解不出的最后一道-imo-题-价值不在答案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a156d48d62c56e56-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">51:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Andrej Karpathy</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0918</span></div>\n<h2>AI 解不出的最后一道 IMO 题，价值不在答案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">2025 年 IMO 第六题只有不到 1% 的选手拿满分，所有 AI 都卡在这题上。它难的不是计算，是必须先理解、先有审美，再动笔——而这恰恰是强化学习最难训练的东西。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 与数学</span><span class=\"tag\">IMO</span>\n</div></div></a>"]